    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχέγονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>original, primal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. ὑγρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>ND</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				24.48
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					5.418
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.472
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.237
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (perh.
			parox. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχεγόνος</span>) <i>first
			author</i> or <i>origin,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φύσις πάσης τέχνης ἀρχέγονόν ἐστ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Damox.
					2.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.88
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὅλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					152
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὠκεανὸς ἀ. πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>ND</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
